# Setka

Read `AGENTS.md` and `REGLAMENT.md`. Default role is orchestrator unless the user named another. Setka agents (`orchestrator`, `backend`, `frontend`, `pentester`, `devops`, `qa`) outrank ECC agents for this workflow.

- Owner flow: `/taskstart` (explain + Q&A) → `/taskend` (spec, tickets, start builders). No product code before `/taskend`.
- Launch harness from terminal: `./setka start` (office, Cursor, 3× Antigravity).
- No product code until approved TV-N tickets exist.
- Prefer `graphify-out/` over reading the whole tree.
- Backend: Django, DRF, Postgres, Redis. Telegram bots: XasanovOzodjon/Telegram-Bot-template.
- Pentester and QA never patch. Failures become tickets for builders.
- Devops compares spec to diff; does not implement features.
- Never commit secrets. Never `git add -A`. Never force-push `main`.
